  /// policy enters the error, disabled, or deleted state, Amazon Data
  /// Lifecycle Manager stops deleting snapshots and AMIs. If you want Amazon
  /// Data Lifecycle Manager to continue deleting snapshots or AMIs, including
  /// the last one, if the policy enters one of these states, specify true .
  /// If you enable extended deletion ( ExtendDeletion=true ), you override
  /// both default behaviors simultaneously. Default: false
  pub extend_deletion: Bool? = None
  /// [Default policies only] Specifies destination Regions for snapshot or
